  "analysis_md": "整理可得\n\n$$\n(x^3y\\,dx+x^4\\,dy)-2y^2\\,dx=0,\n$$\n\n$$\nx^3(y\\,dx+x\\,dy)-y^2(2\\,dx)=0,\n$$\n\n两边同乘 $x^{-5}y^{-2}$ 可得\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{x^2y^2}\\,dxdy-\\frac{2}{x^5}\\,dx=0,\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\nd\\left(-\\frac{1}{xy}+\\frac{1}{2x^4}\\right)=0,\n$$",
